  "skill_summaries": {
    "ultimate": "Passive: all skills require channeling to cast; Active: continuously summon companions to attack enemies",
    "skill1": "AoE explosion after channeling completes",
    "skill2": "AoE blind and ally heal after channeling",
    "skill3": "battle haste increase with extra bonus while channeling ultimate",
    "skill4": "revive a fallen ally after channeling completes",
    "skill5": "recover extra energy while buffed by allies"
  },
  "play_overview": "[[Marcille]] must **channel every skill**, trading instant casts for heavy payoff once each completes without interruption. Her ultimate **continuously summons companions** while active, and channeled AoE blasts and blinds **heal allies** mid-fight when channels land cleanly. Channeling the ultimate also **raises battle haste**, and she can **revive one fallen ally** after a completed cast. She needs **protection and time** so channels finish before control cancels them. Fights that **interrupt her setup** leave much of her heal and summon value unrealized.",
  "counter_overview": "[[Marcille]] **channels every skill** \u2014 companions, AoE blasts, blinds, heals, and a **revive** \u2014 so payoff only lands if casts finish. Break chants with control CC and use [[Lily May]] on her ultimate wind-up before summons and revive land; she is not unaffected mid-channel. **Delete her early** with [[filter:assassin-delete]] like [[Himmel]] or [[Athalia]] before the first channels resolve, and pair [[Pandora]] with [[Lily May]] if a catcher absorbs the first cancel. Once companions are flooding, lasting [[Shemira]] coverage still pressures the stationary caster."
}
